   "final_message": "All 6 sweep points are clean \u2014 DRC 0 and LVS match at every point.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe original `/o21ai.icl` had two geometry bugs:\n\n1. **Diffusion end extension too small**: `nd1` extended only 0.18 \u00b5m beyond the outer gates, but poly.7 requires 0.25 \u00b5m beyond the gate for source/drain contact room. Fixed by using `g1.left - 0.265` / `g3.right + 0.265`.\n\n2. **Wrong gate gap between A1 and B1**: The p-row needs a diffusion island break between A1 and B1 (they can't share a diffusion since their source nets differ), requiring a 0.80 \u00b5m gap. The original used 0.28 \u00b5m everywhere, causing poly.4 (poly-to-diffusion spacing) violations on `pd1`/`pd2` and poly.2 (gate-contact pad pitch) violations. Fixed by using `gap12 = max(0.28, 0.54 - L)` between A2/A1 and `gap23 = 0.80` between A1/B1.\n\nThe resulting layout is parametric (all dimensions derive from `L`, `WN`, `WP`, `WP2`), so it passes the full sweep: L=0.15/0.18/0.25 with nominal widths, widths \u00d70.85/\u00d71.35/\u00d71.9, and heights 2.72/3.26/4.08.",
